msgstr "Kali jość, adčyniaj fajł „index.html” pry ŭvachodzie ŭ kataloh."

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:3847
msgid ""
"A locked view cannot change folders. Use in combination with 'link view' to "
"explore many files from one folder"
msgstr ""
"Dla pryviazanaha prahladu nielha źmianiać kataloh. Karystajsia prahladam "
"łučoŭ, kab prahladać šmat fajłaŭ z adnaho kataloha."

#: src/konqmainwindow.cpp:3848
msgid ""
"Sets the view as 'linked'. A linked view follows folder changes made in "
