#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:143
msgid ""
"Konqueror makes working with and managing your files easy. You can browse "
"both local and networked folders while enjoying advanced features such as "
"the powerful sidebar and file previews."
msgstr ""
"Prahrama „Konqueror” robić kiravańnie fajłami prostaj spravaj. Ty možaš "
"prahladać miascovyja j sietkavyja katalohi. U prahramy šmat raznastajnych "
"zručnaściaŭ, naprykład, bakavaja panel i padhlady fajłaŭ."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:147
msgid ""
"Konqueror is also a full featured and easy to use web browser which you can "
"use to explore the Internet. Enter the address (e.g. <a href=\"http://www."
"kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</a>) of a web page you would like to visit in "
"the location bar and press Enter, or choose an entry from the Bookmarks menu."
msgstr ""
"Prahrama „Konqueror” taksama jość zdolnym i zručnym hartačom sieciva, ź "
"jakim ty možaš prahladać sieciva. Prosta ŭpišy ŭ paneli adras (naprykład, <a "
"href=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</a>) sieciŭnaj staronki i "
"naciśni klavišu „Enter”, albo vybiery jakuju-niebudź zakładku z adpaviednaha "
"menu."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:152
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To return to the previous location, press the back button <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> in the toolbar. "
msgstr ""
"Kab viarnucca na minułaje miesca, klikni ŭ knopku „Nazad” <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img> na paneli pryładździa. "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:155
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To quickly go to your Home folder press the  home button <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>."
msgstr ""
"Kab viarnucca ŭ chatni kataloh, klikni ŭ knopku „Dadomu” <img width='16' "
"height='16' src=\"%1\"></img>. "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:157
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For more detailed documentation on Konqueror click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Kab pračytać padrabiaznuju dakumentacyju pra „Konqueror”, klikni <a href=\"%1"
"\">siudy</a>."

